                                                "sense_id": "0f74f228-bfa1-311c-8aca-92092bdfaad1",
                                                "text": "Prices paid under the contract were 10 times higher than market rates: Lamps that cost 0.22 qepik (US$0.25) at any Baku shop were purchased for about 4 manat (US$5)."
